{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scratch away at your leisure,\u00a0win big money and listen to\u00a0some gloomy generative\u00a0dark jazz!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who knows, maybe that\u00a0locked door will open at some\u00a0point and you can get out of\u00a0this strange gas station in the\u00a0middle of nowhere...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controls: <br>Look around with the mouse <br>Click to move <br>Press I to open and close the inventory <br>Esc to quit</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep an eye on your energy bar\u00a0on the bottom of the screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Options:</i> <br><i>Shift+0 to toggle between normal and performance mode</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Up/Down to adjust motion blur</i> <br><i>Shift+Arrow Left/Right to adjust mouse sensitivity</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 cinematic scratch ticket experience \ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 pre-rendered 360\u00b0 backgrounds\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 real-time algorithmically generated soundtrack\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 12 different scratch tickets\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 5 different energy drinks\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcb0 relaxing solitude\u00a0\ud83d\udcb0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3414240?t=1745841373","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/e0edb54a4fc8d43ec7de9fb9c8b41ed99670369c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745841373","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3414240/1197565c23894ddbf0502a234b85870575d5338f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745841373","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass